flowchart TD
    U[Employee task] --> P[Planner]
    P --> T[TEE / Protected Runtime]
    T <-->|fixed receiver-only PSI slot| E[Enterprise Agent Directory]
    T <-->|fixed scheduled PIR slot| A[Global Agent Library]
    T --> R[Private ResolvedAgentTarget]
    R --> G[Existing Trusted Gateway ingress]
    G --> EA[Enterprise-deployed Agent]
    G --> GA[Global-library Agent]
    G --> LLM[Remote LLM]
    G --> API[External Tool / API]
    G --> APP[Local application]

    F[Fixed Agent-resolution profile] -.-> T
    F --- P1[One PSI slot: padded K=8 / E=1024]
    F --- P2[One PIR slot: real or padding row]
    F --- P3[Hit / fallback structurally identical]

    PSI[PSI hides enterprise availability query] -.-> E
    PIR[PIR hides global-library index] -.-> A
    GW[Gateway is the common observer-visible boundary] -.-> G
